  "prefLabel": "Rev 406.01 Definition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 406.01 Definition. For purposes of this part, “service-connected total disability tax credit” means the standard or optional service-connected total and permanent disability tax credits pursuant to RSA 72:35.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08 (from Rev 404.01); #ss by 12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 405.01)",
